1
00:00:00,772 --> 00:00:04,022
(Raj:)You should write that down
before someone steals it.

2
00:00:04,193 --> 00:00:06,113
(Howard:)So when do the meteors get here?

3
00:00:06,278 --> 00:00:09,818
(Raj:)The meteors don't get here.
The Earth is moving into their path.

4
00:00:09,990 --> 00:00:12,200
(Leonard:)I can feel it.

5
00:00:13,785 --> 00:00:17,125
I can feel the Earth moving. Heh.

6
00:00:18,373 --> 00:00:21,163
(Leonard:)It's moving too fast. Raj, slow it down.

7
00:00:30,385 --> 00:00:32,225
(Raj:)Okay, how's that?

8
00:00:33,180 --> 00:00:34,470
(Leonard:)Better, thanks.

9
00:00:36,517 --> 00:00:38,597
(Leonard:)Stars are pretty, aren't they?

10
00:00:38,769 --> 00:00:40,189
[RAJESH LAUGHING]

11
00:00:43,315 --> 00:00:44,485
(Leonard:)What's so funny?

12
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:48,650
(Raj:)It's your American accent. Everything
you say sounds stupid. Ha-ha-ha.

13
00:00:50,113 --> 00:00:51,863
[IMITATING LEONARD]
"Stars are pretty, aren't they?"

14
00:00:52,032 --> 00:00:53,532
[RAJESH & HOWARD LAUGHING]

15
00:00:54,576 --> 00:01:00,026
[CHUCKLES THEN LAUGHING]

